  "description": "A toolbox of composable building blocks for Orleans grains that need\n      atomic state writes, transactional outbox, receiver-side dedup, and\n      stream subscription management. Pick what you need, leave the rest.",
  "id": "Egil.Orleans.Messaging",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-22T09:22:09.863Z",
