  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New Features:\n- add preview journaling companion package\n  Add named durable outboxes and message trackers which share Orleans journal commits with business state. Preserve the existing immutable types through zero-copy AsImmutable access, derive net outbox deltas, and leave save and post ordering under grain control. Public interfaces follow Orleans conventions while preview dependencies remain isolated from core OM. Include lifecycle and failure coverage, a packed-package restart consumer, setup documentation, and independent preview versioning.\n- add synchronous outbox acknowledgement (#214)\n  Add AcknowledgePosted for grains whose acknowledgement only updates in-memory state, avoiding a redundant completed ValueTask. Require at least one posted acknowledgement callback and run the synchronous callback before AcknowledgePostedAsync when both are configured.\n  Document the API and cover synchronous-only registration, missing callback validation, and combined callback ordering.",
